{"game": "mass-effect-3", "language": "english", "appid": 1238020, "month": "2020-12", "window": 2, "start_date": 1607385600, "end_date": 1608076799, "month_true_total": 87, "quota": 7, "returned": 7, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 19:52:17 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "82443288", "author": {"steamid": "76561198119590583", "personaname": "Cuppy Cup", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/servingcvnt/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 7, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7, "last_played": 1608004487, "avatar": "09c36e7f3cfed73671466fd0755d0d0e46c57a40"}, "language": "english", "review": "The steam/EA launcher will not recognize physx.", "timestamp_created": 1608054178, "timestamp_updated": 1608054178, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 8, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.546827793121337891", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "82441015", "author": {"steamid": "76561198145363654", "personaname": "Largezo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198145363654/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 54, "playtime_forever": 2248, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2248, "last_played": 1608051348, "avatar": "ea9e525e8c1768375a2c5b2f61a899a3ff3f3b5f"}, "language": "english", "review": "What can I say? It's a beautiful game; well-written, easy-to-grasp and enthralling. It's an unique combination of dry humor and death, there's lots of it especially if you played the entire trilogy on renegade like I did. The shooting is fun and characters profound. Although the ending could have been better, there is at least one option I'm happy with. For years I've hoped for a new ME game and it seems like there's going to be one. I have high hopes.", "timestamp_created": 1608051870, "timestamp_updated": 1608051870, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "82421544", "author": {"steamid": "76561198394158855", "personaname": "Ezqxll", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198394158855/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 48, "playtime_forever": 3263, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3263, "last_played": 1608031662, "avatar": "ebfb09cfd46b93bf086a00027f0b03cea0604426"}, "language": "english", "review": "Hated the game at first since there was no jump and the keybind was quite frustrating. I was lost on maps trying to wayfind as I didn't know how to move around uneven terrain. Almost quit the game before I hit 2 hours.\n\nThen I got a mod to split the jump/cover key and things started getting better. I played this game after playing Andromeda and my opinion of that has reduced massively after playing this. ME 3 has all the elements of a RPG, decent combat, well written characters and an immersive environment.  I think it is time for me to give ME 2 a try.", "timestamp_created": 1608032036, "timestamp_updated": 1608032036, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "82366309", "author": {"steamid": "76561198040028102", "personaname": "Quellor", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198040028102/", "num_games_owned": 278, "num_reviews": 88, "playtime_forever": 2178, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2178, "last_played": 1607970926, "avatar": "548511aa250b092d2d6266940f525cf49595d8ea"}, "language": "english", "review": "ME3 is the end if the Mass Effect Trilogy. The gameplay, characters and story (ending excluded) are still great and have a lot of variety. The whole journey is worthwhile and during the game you can team up with some of the squadmates from the previous games or meet them on missions. \n\nWhen I first played this I was extremely disapointed with the ending (think game of thrones last season level), but the extended cut has improved it a bit. My ME3 Paragon playthrough was 36 hours of fun will play it again sometime as a Renegade.", "timestamp_created": 1607971970, "timestamp_updated": 1607971970, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "82359090", "author": {"steamid": "76561198984540060", "personaname": "IndigoFox", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198984540060/", "num_games_owned": 481, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 311, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 88, "last_played": 1608099565, "avatar": "fb293bbac4dfbbd98a85fa04dbbd98ad8395d394"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is a good game that I come back to every year. It launched when I first got it, but now it doesn't even load. Contacted EA support, was pointed to steam support, then back in a circle to EA.", "timestamp_created": 1607964828, "timestamp_updated": 1607964828, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 9, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.581869304180145264", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "82321569", "author": {"steamid": "76561198327317166", "personaname": "Homeland Helper", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/homelandhelper/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 544, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 332, "last_played": 1615779434, "avatar": "cb643875ea0b31fc06109ecd3403ce64f23f8b47"}, "language": "english", "review": "great game", "timestamp_created": 1607921381, "timestamp_updated": 1607921381, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "82255026", "author": {"steamid": "76561198063038180", "personaname": "BertrandRustled", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198063038180/", "num_games_owned": 553, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 5, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5, "last_played": 1606168236, "avatar": "25d2c151b13fda62e8a73140d04661d55feeb635"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's Mass Effect. Mass Effect is great. But at the moment, waiting for the trilogy remaster is probably a good idea. \n\nUnless you just gotta scratch that itch ;)", "timestamp_created": 1607853138, "timestamp_updated": 1607853138, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}]}